@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:9754
# 以下是假句柄/模拟ID；先手动执行目录与生成请求，再复制实际响应ID。
# 不要“运行全部”：生成/验证会调用所选模式，配置变更会修改本地后端内存。
@productId = REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID
@outlineId = REPLACE_WITH_OUTLINE_ID
@outlineVersion = 1
@runId = REPLACE_WITH_RESULT_ID
@revision = 1
@renderHandle = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 状态（不会返回密钥）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/status

### 目录
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### 销售员场景与客户建议
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/task-options

### 保存配置的安全空样例：空白密钥保留原值
# 完整可选字段见frontend-handoff.md；实际凭证仅在本机接入表单填写，不写进此文件。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/connections/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{"apiKey":"","imaClientId":"","imaApiKey":""}

### 模型连接验证（真实调用，有用量）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/connections/model/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ima只读连接验证
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/connections/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 生成大纲：有本地资料才能运行规则演示
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/outlines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId":"{{productId}}",
  "audience":"大学新生",
  "scene":"开学季",
  "goal":"到店体验",
  "buyingStage":"对比选择",
  "platforms":["xiaohongshu","wechat"],
  "instructions":"语气自然，不编造价格或亲测经历。",
  "mode":"demo",
  "knowledgeSource":"local"
}

### 当前大纲
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/outlines/{{outlineId}}

### 完整保存形状：仅纯模拟示例，必须用GET响应中的platforms与引用替换
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/outlines/{{outlineId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version":{{outlineVersion}},
  "platforms":[{
    "platform":"moments","title":"纯模拟的选购核对清单","angle":"纯模拟场景","intro":"此处不提供产品事实。",
    "sections":[{"id":"mock-section","heading":"核对要点","points":["只用于协议形状展示"],"factIds":[]}],
    "imageIds":[],"cta":"请替换为实际大纲中的内容与引用。"
  }]
}

### AI修改（规则演示支持精简；模型模式可自由改写）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/outlines/{{outlineId}}/revise
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{outlineVersion}},"instructions":"精简"}

### 确认当前保存版，旧版本应返回409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/outlines/{{outlineId}}/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{outlineVersion}}}

### 只有已确认当前版可进入正文；响应为SSE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/generate-from-outline
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{"outlineId":"{{outlineId}}","version":{{outlineVersion}}}

### 受控模板目录
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/render-templates

### 按实际正文ID和revision渲染小红书
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/render
Content-Type: application/json

{"runId":"{{runId}}","revision":{{revision}},"platform":"xiaohongshu","selectedTitleIndex":0,"templateId":"xhs-cream"}

### 公众号：同一run必须已经含wechat稿件
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/render
Content-Type: application/json

{"runId":"{{runId}}","revision":{{revision}},"platform":"wechat","selectedTitleIndex":0,"templateId":"wechat-editorial"}

### 朋友圈：需先用moments任务完成独立大纲和正文
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/render
Content-Type: application/json

{"runId":"{{runId}}","revision":{{revision}},"platform":"moments","selectedTitleIndex":0,"templateId":"moments-square"}

### 门店海报：需先用poster任务完成独立大纲和正文
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/render
Content-Type: application/json

{"runId":"{{runId}}","revision":{{revision}},"platform":"poster","selectedTitleIndex":0,"templateId":"poster-paper"}

### 预览字节：使用响应实际句柄；下面的模拟句柄返回410
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/render-assets/{{renderHandle}}

### 下载字节：blocked应返回409；ZIP也使用同一路由
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/render-assets/{{renderHandle}}?download=1

### 兼容：旧示例仍返回RunResult，不是大纲
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sample

### 兼容：旧正文修订，返回SSE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/revise
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{"runId":"{{runId}}","instructions":"精简文案"}

### 兼容：旧直接生成（新前端不用此路径跳过确认）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{"productId":"{{productId}}","audience":"大学新生","scene":"开学季","platforms":["moments"],"mode":"demo","knowledgeSource":"local"}
